    <bpmn:process id="W_W5133" name="W5133. Boundary Dispute, Land Survey &amp; Technical Description Verification" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Approved due diligence (W5130); boundary dispute or technical overlap suspected
Frequency: Per site acquisition
Volume: ~15–20 surveys annually
Owner: Geodetic Engineer (In-house/Contracted) / Land Acquisition Specialist
Participants: Adjacent Landowners, LGU City/Municipal Engineer, Denr-LMS (Land Management Services)
Source: workflow W5133 — Boundary Dispute, Land Survey &amp; Technical Description Verification</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5133_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5133_Lane1" name="Geodetic Engineer (In-house">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5133_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5133_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5133_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5133_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5133_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5133_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5133_Start3" name="Approved due diligence (W5130); boundary dispute or technical overlap suspected">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5133_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5133_Task4" name="Obtain Approved Subdivision Plan, cadastral maps, and technical descriptions…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Obtain Approved Subdivision Plan, cadastral maps, and technical descriptions from the DENR Land Management Bureau.
Responsible (R): Geodetic Engineer (In-house/Contracted) / Land Acquisition Specialist
Accountable (A): Geodetic Engineer (In-house/Contracted) / Land Acquisition Specialist
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5133_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5133_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5133_Task5" name="Conduct physical boundary survey (re-survey and monumenting) to verify actual…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Conduct physical boundary survey (re-survey and monumenting) to verify actual lot coordinates and areas.
Responsible (R): Geodetic Engineer (In-house/Contracted) / Land Acquisition Specialist
Accountable (A): Geodetic Engineer (In-house/Contracted) / Land Acquisition Specialist
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5133_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5133_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5133_Task6" name="Compare physical survey data with TCT technical descriptions to identify…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Compare physical survey data with TCT technical descriptions to identify overlaps, encroaching structures, or easements.
Responsible (R): Geodetic Engineer (In-house/Contracted) / Land Acquisition Specialist
Accountable (A): Geodetic Engineer (In-house/Contracted) / Land Acquisition Specialist
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5133_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5133_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5133_Task7" name="Obtain boundary alignment sign-offs (Barangay/LGU mediation or amicable…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Obtain boundary alignment sign-offs (Barangay/LGU mediation or amicable boundary agreement) from adjacent landowners.
Responsible (R): Geodetic Engineer (In-house/Contracted) / Land Acquisition Specialist
Accountable (A): Geodetic Engineer (In-house/Contracted) / Land Acquisition Specialist
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5133_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5133_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5133_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5133_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-141 (ensure land title &amp; acquisition due diligence.) | - CTL-764: Survey report sealed and signed by licensed Geodetic Engineer; DENR approved plan secured; adjacent owner sign-offs notarized.
Owner: Geodetic Engineer (In-house/Contracted) / Land Acquisition Specialist</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
