Frequency: Event-driven per consolidation necessity
Volume: ~3–5 consolidations annually
Owner: Director, Facilities &amp; Real Estate / Geodetic Engineer
Participants: DENR Land Management Bureau, Registry of Deeds, Legal Operations (VS-100)
Source: workflow W5136 — Land Title Consolidation &amp; Subdivision (Subdivision of Lots)</bpmn:documentation>
