      <bpmn:userTask id="W5136_Task4" name="Engage Geodetic Engineer to draft a Consolidated Subdivision Plan joining…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Engage Geodetic Engineer to draft a Consolidated Subdivision Plan joining multiple lots and dedicating road widening/easement strips.
Responsible (R): Director, Facilities &amp; Real Estate / Geodetic Engineer
Accountable (A): Director, Facilities &amp; Real Estate / Geodetic Engineer
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5136_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5136_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
