        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Submit Consolidation Plan to the DENR-LMB / LGU City Planning Office for verification and technical approval.
Responsible (R): Director, Facilities &amp; Real Estate / Geodetic Engineer
Accountable (A): Director, Facilities &amp; Real Estate / Geodetic Engineer
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5136_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5136_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5136_Task6" name="Obtain DENR Technical Approval Certificate for the consolidated plan.">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Obtain DENR Technical Approval Certificate for the consolidated plan.
Responsible (R): Director, Facilities &amp; Real Estate / Geodetic Engineer
Accountable (A): Director, Facilities &amp; Real Estate / Geodetic Engineer
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5136_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5136_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5136_Task7" name="File approved plan with the Registry of Deeds to cancel old TCTs and issue a…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: File approved plan with the Registry of Deeds to cancel old TCTs and issue a single consolidated TCT for the BuildRight store site.
Responsible (R): Director, Facilities &amp; Real Estate / Geodetic Engineer
Accountable (A): Director, Facilities &amp; Real Estate / Geodetic Engineer
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5136_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5136_End8" name="Complete">
